.Dd November 11, 2026
.Dt SYSD 8
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm sysd
.Nd RavenBSD system information server
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
registers the
.Dq sys:
scheme.
The directory contains these files:
.Bl -tag -width "hostname"
.It Va hostname
System hostname, read/write, default
.Dq raven ,
at most 63 bytes.
A write replaces the hostname and ignores one trailing newline.
.It Va uname
The five
.Xr uname 1
fields, one per line: sysname, nodename, release, version and machine.
.It Va version
The
.Xr uname 1
version field.
.It Va uptime
Seconds since boot from
.Dv CLOCK_MONOTONIC .
.It Va kernel
The system name, release and version on one line.
.El
.Pp
All files end with a newline.
Only
.Va hostname
is writable.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /etc/services.d -compact
.It Pa /etc/services.d/sysd.toml
Service manifest.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr uname 1 ,
.Xr logd 8 ,
.Xr init 8
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
